&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph normal ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;2647&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;2647&quot;&gt;Unlimited paid time off, including seasonal (December) company-wide time off&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph normal ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;2725&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;2725&quot;&gt;Paid parental and medical leave&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
