&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(224, 62, 45);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Our &lt;strong&gt;Raleigh Skilled Nursing Office&lt;/strong&gt; is interested in a &lt;strong&gt;Licensed Practical Nurse (LPN)&lt;/strong&gt; who has a passion for care to join our team.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(224, 62, 45);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;We believe our clients and their families deserve the highest quality care delivered with compassion, excellence, and reliability.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Choose BAYADA?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We pride ourselves on providing an excellent onboarding and training experience from Day 1.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;During your &lt;em&gt;paid&lt;/em&gt; training and orientation, you can expect to learn valuable &lt;strong&gt;hands-on skills in our simulation lab&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;in-home meet and greets&lt;/strong&gt; with our clients before working independently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Receive 24/7 on-call support while working for your clinical and administrative questions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy and incredible culture and team environment, while having the independence of a home care nurse!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;All BAYADA Skilled Nurses Enjoy: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Weekly paychecks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible schedules that work for you&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consistency and transparency in available hours with access to open shifts in real time and the ability to always request additional working hours when desired&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;One-to-one client care&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scholarship opportunities, free courses, and on-the-job training&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;$1,200 nurse referral bonus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What your day will look like at BAYADA: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel to &lt;strong&gt;one&lt;/strong&gt; client near you&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Follow up with, execute, and properly document doctors&#39; orders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform assessments and monitor clients&#39; conditions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Document observations, interventions, and evaluations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Feel empowered to perform skills with autonomy both in the client&#39;s home and at school&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&#39;re honored to be recognized as: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Newsweek&#39;s Greatest Workplace for: Overall, Women, Parents &amp;amp; Families, and Diversity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Forbes Best Employers for Veterans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications for a private duty LPN: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Graduation from an accredited and approved nursing program, as indicated by school transcript or diploma&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A current nursing license in good standing in the state&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Preferred: &lt;/em&gt;One year of experience working as a nurse (LPN or RN)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation &amp;amp; Schedule: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pay up to $32/hour based on qualifications and availability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunities for higher pay dependent on client availability!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SER-RDU&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: black;&quot;&gt;As an accredited, regulated, certified, and licensed home health care provider, BAYADA complies with all state/local mandates.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
