&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Manage and maintain RHEL systems across development, testing, and production environments&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;• Design, implement, and support OpenShift container platforms&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;• Administer and troubleshoot JBoss application servers&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;• Utilise Red Hat Satellite for system provisioning, patching, and configuration management&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;• Implement security best practices and ensure compliance with industry standards&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;• Perform system upgrades, patches, and maintenance tasks&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;• Develop and maintain documentation for system configurations and processes&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;• Collaborate with development teams to support application deployment and operations&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;• Participate in on-call rotations for critical system support&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
